# VizieR mirror list
# Lines starting with '#' and blank lines are ignored.
# Source: https://vizier.unistra.fr/mirrors.html  (April 2026)
#
# Use bare server-root URLs (scheme + host + trailing slash, no portal sub-path).
# The VizieR CGI endpoint /viz-bin/VizieR is always at the server root on
# every mirror, so portal sub-paths such as /vizier/ must NOT be included here.
#
# Mirror                               Location
http://vizier.cds.unistra.fr/          # CDS, Strasbourg, France
http://vizier.nao.ac.jp/               # ADAC, Tokyo, Japan
https://vizier.iucaa.in/               # IUCAA, Pune, India
http://vizier.china-vo.org/            # NAOC, Beijing, China
https://vizier.cfa.harvard.edu/        # CfA Harvard, Cambridge, USA
http://vizier.idia.ac.za/              # IDIA, South Africa

